1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Reading Task

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,500
Caught by a Black Hole

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:11,620
The spaceship warned Li Enping and me to be ready as we were approaching the Black Hole.

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,580
We could see some faint lights around what looked like an empty space.

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,160
Those lights are things that are being pulled into it by the gravity of the hole."

6
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:28,700
We watched

7
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,760
with interest and amazement at the lights which seemed to be going fainter

8
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:35,020
and fainter round the edge of the black hole.

9
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:40,660
Just then the lights on our spaceship went out and the computer stopped working.

10
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,220
What was happening?

11
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:47,480
I tried to turn the spaceship away from the hole but it would not move.

12
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,480
Would it eat us too?

13
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:55,120
Suddenly the spaceship jumped and began to move round the edge of the hole too.

14
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,140
The gravity of the "black hole" was pulling us into its "mouth".

15
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:02,720
As the spaceship moved round the black hole,

16
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,340
I felt rather sick.

17
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:08,020
My mouth went dry and I closed my eyes.

18
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:14,040
All the stories about what happened when you were caught by the gravity of a "black hole" seemed to be true.

19
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:16,800
But then the spaceship jumped again.

20
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:21,260
This time it moved sideways and away from the edge of the "black hole".

21
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:28,560
Someone watching me would have seen the spaceship flying like a bird away from the "black hole".

22
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:30,760
But we felt nothing.

23
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:34,820
At last we were able to look around us.

24
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:37,660
Luckily the computer had started working again.

25
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:42,060
We realized that we had discovered something new about "black holes".

26
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,980
If you go inside the edge of a "black hole",

27
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:49,320
it will "eat" you and there is no escape;

28
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:53,540
but if you do not, you may have an opportunity to escape.

29
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:54,880
How exciting!
